# Wave-4 W4C-3 transitional bridge (WO-C1 symlink law — ADR:
# docs/architecture/adr-wave4-c6-host.md). @zcode/web does not yet
# declare @sporta/* workspace dependencies (root manifests and
# pnpm-lock.yaml are TL-owned). Until the TL registers them, the sporta
# host composition resolves @sporta/* through these GITIGNORED symlinks:
#
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/product       -> ../../../sporta-product
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/contracts     -> ../../../sporta-contracts
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/work          -> ../../../sporta-work
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/organizations -> ../../../sporta-organizations
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/artifacts     -> ../../../sporta-artifacts
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/editors       -> ../../../sporta-editors
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/arena         -> ../../../sporta-arena
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/lab           -> ../../../sporta-lab
#   packages/web/node_modules/@sporta/evaluation    -> ../../../sporta-evaluation
#
# NEVER commit these symlinks, never run `pnpm install` at the workspace
# root after editing a manifest, and never commit pnpm-lock.yaml or the
# root package.json. The definitive registration is recorded in the
# worker-c wave-4 report under NEXT DEPENDENCIES.
